  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Talk about studies",
   "texto": [
    "**Fag** is a subject or matter; **timeplan** is the class schedule. **Friminutt** is the break or break between classes.",
    "To explain a reason, use **fordi** («because»): **Jeg øver fordi jeg har eksamen**. In the prayer that begins with **fordi**, **ikke** goes before the verb: **fordi jeg ikke forstår**. In Spanish, denial usually goes after the verb: «Because I don't understand.»."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Studies and work",
   "texto": [
    "In Norway, **samfunnskunnskap** is a matter of society. **Oppmøte** means class attendance; **fravær**, absence. **Bestå en eksamen** is to pass a test."
   ]
  },
